Wait — the skill warns about env. Let me set MODO_TESTE at top of file rather than in the test, before requiring app. Actually app reads it at request time (I'll read in handler). Setting in beforeEach is fine. But cleaner: set at top before requiring src/app. Since app reads process.env at handling time, either works. I'll set at top: `process.env.MODO_TESTE = '1';`.

