parts.text:
R6: each encontro must start and end on the same civil day and be within the event period 19/10/2026 to 23/10/2026, Brasília time. Fora → ENCONTRO_INVALIDO.

Tests to cover:
1. encontro start on one day and ends next day → 422 ENCONTRO_INVALIDO. E.g., inicio 2026-10-19T23:00:00-03:00, fim 2026-10-20T00:30:00-03:00 (1h30 duration, valid per R5, but crosses midnight). Note: duration 1h30 within [1h,4h], so R5 passes, R6 fires. Good isolation.
2. encontro before 19/10 → e.g., inicio 2026-10-18T19:00:00-03:00, fim 2026-10-18T20:00:00-03:00 (1h, same day, but before period). → 422.
